    <!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════
         PART G · WHY INFRASTRUCTURE GOES OVER BUDGET
    ════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
    <h2 class="sec" id="part-g-why-infrastructure-always-costs-more-than-planned">Part G · why infrastructure always costs more than planned</h2>

    <div class="card u-mb-lg">
      <div class="u-fs-13px u-fw-500 text-primary u-mb-xs">Famous cost overruns: budget vs. final cost</div>
      <div class="u-fs-11px text-secondary u-mb-md">The green bar is the original budget. The orange overlay is the actual final cost. All figures inflation-adjusted.</div>

      <!-- Sydney Opera House -->
      <div class="overrun-bar-wrap">
